{"id":"n","title":"Calculator keypad","stmts":[{"op":"goto","label":"_N_MENU"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_NO_MENU"},{"op":"label","name":"N1"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_S_N1"},{"op":"banner","text":"Lesson N1"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L0"},{"op":"tutorial","lines":["","\t\t\tNumeric Keypad Lessons","","The N series lessons are provided for practice with the numeric keys available","on the H89/H19 terminal.  You do not need to know how to touch type on the","standard keyboard in order to learn touch typing on a calculator keypad.  So,","you can begin this series right away.","","When entering numeric values, accuracy is usually more important than speed.","Take these lessons very slowly.  Speed will come naturally later.","","As with the standard keypad, you must start in the HOME position.  Place the","first three fingers of your right hand over the 4, 5, and 6 keys of the keypad.","(Your thumb and fifth finger are not used.)  Your fingers should be poised just","over the keys gently brushing them.  Use the thumb or any finger of your left","hand for other keys, such as the SPACE bar.","","After entering each line, hit the ENTER key with the 6-finger (the third finger","of your right hand).  Immediately return your finger to the 6 key.  It is very","important that you bring the finger back without looking."]},{"op":"instruction","lines":["Use your third finger only."]},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L1"},{"op":"drill","kind":"D","text":"666666\n"},{"op":"instruction","lines":["Use your second finger for the 5."]},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L2"},{"op":"drill","kind":"D","text":"6565656\n"},{"op":"instruction","lines":["Use your first finger for the 4."]},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L3"},{"op":"drill","kind":"D","text":"666444555444666\n"},{"op":"instruction","lines":["Now let's try several lines."]},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L4"},{"op":"drill","kind":"S","text":"666444666\n444555666\n555444555\n666444666\n646464646\n656565656\n445566555\n456456456\n"},{"op":"instruction","lines":["Use your second finger for the period."]},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L5"},{"op":"drill","kind":"D","text":"555...555\n"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L6"},{"op":"drill","kind":"S","text":"5.54.45.56.6\n444.555\n45.56.6\n64.65.4\n54.65.4\n"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L7"},{"op":"drill","kind":"S","text":"445566.654\n654456.546\n546546.564\n554466.645\n555444.666\n"},{"op":"instruction","lines":["Use your first finger for the 1-key."]},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L8"},{"op":"drill","kind":"D","text":"444111444.444111444\n"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L9"},{"op":"drill","kind":"S","text":"111.444\n414.141\n456.546\n415.164\n541.146\n"},{"op":"instruction","lines":["Now, let's review the keys we've learned."]},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L10"},{"op":"drill","kind":"D","text":"444555666111...555444666111\n"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L11"},{"op":"drill","kind":"S","text":"414.564\n546.145\n546.145\n644.146\n615.645\n564.145\n546.164\n111.555\n514.651\n"},{"op":"goto","label":"_N_E_N1"},{"op":"label","name":"N2"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_S_N2"},{"op":"banner","text":"Lesson N2"},{"op":"instruction","lines":["First, let's review the keys from lesson 1."]},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L12"},{"op":"drill","kind":"D","text":"444.555.666.111.6541.6541\n"},{"op":"instruction","lines":["Use your 5-finger for the 2 key."]},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L13"},{"op":"drill","kind":"D","text":"555222555.525.525.525\n"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L14"},{"op":"drill","kind":"S","text":"45.25\n52.52\n62.62\n22.22\n51.12\n12.52\n24.42\n"},{"op":"instruction","lines":["Use your 6-finger for the 3 key."]},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L15"},{"op":"drill","kind":"D","text":"666333666.636.636\n"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L16"},{"op":"drill","kind":"S","text":"456.123\n321.654\n666.333\n323.353\n343.313\n353.363\n313.434\n"},{"op":"label","name":"_N_R_L17"},{"op":"drill","kind":"S","text":"12.33\n45.33\n65.35\n12.35\n65.25\n25.63\n43.53\n13.36\n34.31\n"},{"op":"instruction","lines":["Use 